00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:04.571 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I want
to talk about your movie.

00:00:04.571 --> 00:00:05.939 align:start size:94% position:6%
For those
who might not have noticed -

00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:07.741 size:88% position:44%
-Those are real puppies.
-Those are real puppies.

00:00:07.741 --> 00:00:08.641 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Real puppies.

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:10.510 align:start size:94% position:6%
