of Kevin Costner.

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:12.879 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The real voice of
the one and only Kevin Costner

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:14.214 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's like his inner thoughts.
-Yeah.

00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:15.582 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is not a --
-That was -- yeah, Parker.

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:18.585
