-Did you -- What has --

00:00:29.596 --> 00:00:31.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, in the course
of the movie --

00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:32.932 align:start size:94% position:6%
And again, this isn't a film
where you're

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:34.167 align:start size:94% position:6%
