-No, no.

00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:42.042 align:start size:94% position:6%
I met Kevin on Thursday.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:44.711 align:start size:94% position:6%
I made the movie last year
-Gotcha.

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:47.080 line:92%
-Yeah, no, Kevin wasn't on set

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:48.081 align:start size:94% position:6%
I didn't even really
need to hear

00:00:48.081 --> 00:00:51.217 align:start size:94% position:6%
