was in the dog's head.

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:54.087 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.
-All in the dog's head.

00:00:54.087 --> 00:00:57.323
So, for me, it was kind of like,
work with the dog, say a line,

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:59.592 align:start size:94% position:6%
