00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:03.163
I'm like, "Interact with the
dog, interact with the dog."

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:05.865 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then -- then like,
"Okay, and action."

00:01:05.865 --> 00:01:07.500 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then I say my line.
-Right.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.235 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was all, like,
there's someone back there

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:11.337 size:78% position:39%
