00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:13.606 align:start size:94% position:6%
Kevin's talking.
Kevin's gonna be talking,

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:14.908 align:start size:94% position:6%
and done.
Milo, go."

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:17.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That is -- that was the first
time you ever met Kevin

00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:19.179
was on Thursday at the premiere?
-Yeah.

00:01:19.179 --> 00:01:20.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He's a good guy.
-Dude, he's awesome.

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:23.850 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-I was mildly shell-shocked.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:26.886 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just like, "He's Kevin Costner
I mean, I've been a fan

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:28.021 align:start size:94% position:6%
