that he's done for years."

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:32.325
But he was so warm and so lovely
and supportive of the film

00:01:32.325 --> 00:01:33.660 line:92%
-And it's pretty great, for him,

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:35.595 align:start size:94% position:6%
you just realize
the kind of star he is.

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:36.963 align:start size:94% position:6%
You had to work months
on that movie.

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:38.498 align:start size:94% position:6%
He probably knocked it out
in a day.

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:39.699 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Two days.
-Yeah.

00:01:39.699 --> 00:01:40.900 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:41.734 line:92%
He didn't even have to, like

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:43.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
match a talking dog's mout
or anything.

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:45.638 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No. No, no, no.
None of that.

00:01:45.638 --> 00:01:47.173 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He was living his best life
yeah.

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:49.042 size:78% position:39%
