some of those jobs.

00:01:49.042 --> 00:01:51.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You play a racecar driver
in the film.

00:01:51.177 --> 00:01:53.947
We've talked in the past
that you love motorcycles.

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:56.549
-Yeah.
-Did you have to do any thinking

00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:59.152 align:start size:94% position:6%
about what made a good racecar
driver for this film?

00:01:59.152 --> 00:02:01.554 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know what?
I kind of equated acting -

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:03.189 align:start size:94% position:6%
I kind of, like, took raceca
driving as, like,

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:04.524 align:start size:94% position:6%
laid it right over
being an actor.

00:02:04.524 --> 00:02:06.359 align:start size:94% position:6%
You have the same focus,
have the same determination.

00:02:06.359 --> 00:02:09.529
You kind of have that huma
spirit to, like, do good.

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:10.830 size:81% position:41% line:92%
So that part was easy.

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
For me, it was more like,
"Hey, let me focus

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:15.201 align:start size:94% position:6%
on being a father,
focus on being a husband.

00:02:15.201 --> 00:02:16.569 align:start size:94% position:6%
Let me focus on being
a best friend

00:02:16.569 --> 00:02:19.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
