-There you go.

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:20.073 align:start size:94% position:6%
That works.
-Yeah.

00:02:20.073 --> 00:02:21.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I know
we were just talking backstage

00:02:21.341 --> 00:02:23.810 align:start size:94% position:6%
You just started shooting
this season of "This Is Us."

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:25.712 align:start size:94% position:6%
You had a little bit
of time off this summer.

00:02:25.712 --> 00:02:27.547 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you travel at all?
-I did.

00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:28.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
Man, I kind of circled
