Excuse my ignorance.

00:02:36.256 --> 00:02:38.458 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you just rent a motorcycl
when you go to Japan?

00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:40.593 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, they rented one for me.
