that I speed.

00:05:12.979 --> 00:05:14.847 align:start size:94% position:6%
Which I don't entirely
all the time.

00:05:14.847 --> 00:05:15.248 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Gotcha.

00:05:15.248 --> 00:05:19.752
-No, for me, it's always ful
sleeves, full face helmet,

00:05:19.752 --> 00:05:22.955 align:start size:94% position:6%
