or denim or something.

00:05:22.955 --> 00:05:24.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, like, take your time.
-All right, gotcha.

00:05:24.824 --> 00:05:27.493 align:start size:94% position:6%
So the first time you're ridin
a new kind of bike,

00:05:27.493 --> 00:05:28.761 align:start size:94% position:6%
