all the same?

00:05:30.029 --> 00:05:31.798 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay, gotcha.
-No, they're all different

00:05:31.798 --> 00:05:32.699 size:81% position:41% line:92%
They're all different.

00:05:32.699 --> 00:05:34.267 align:start size:94% position:6%
Your bike kind of becomes
an extension of you.

00:05:34.267 --> 00:05:35.535 size:84% position:42%
Like, that's the thing.
So when I was in Japan,

00:05:35.535 --> 00:05:37.537
and I was riding with Norman
it was like -- they put me -

00:05:37.537 --> 00:05:39.772 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like, "Please just put m
