00:05:43.176 --> 00:05:45.645 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, they put me on a Harley,
but still, it was just --

00:05:45.645 --> 00:05:46.412 size:81% position:41% line:92%
It was just different.

00:05:46.412 --> 00:05:48.348 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right,
because of the exchange rate

00:05:48.348 --> 00:05:51.484 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:05:51.484 --> 00:05:52.151 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yes.

00:05:52.151 --> 00:05:53.486 align:start size:94% position:6%
The exchange rate.
That's exactly --

00:05:53.486 --> 00:05:57.090 size:84% position:42%
-Yeah, I'm sort of a --
I'm a grease guy, too.

00:05:57.090 --> 00:05:58.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, totally.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:58.157 --> 00:06:01.561 align:start size:94% position:6%
